---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="More about Alex.Immer and the chip tune music player project">
  <section class="py-2xl-responsive px-lg-responsive">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <div class="text-center mb-4xl-responsive">
        <!-- ASCII Art Container with responsive scaling -->
        <div class='mb-lg-responsive"'>
          <pre
            class="ascii-art text-palette-900 dark:text-white retro-text-subtle-glow">
     █████╗ ██╗     ███████╗██╗  ██╗   ██╗███╗   ███╗███╗   ███╗███████╗██████╗
     ██╔══██╗██║     ██╔════╝╚██╗██╔╝   ██║████╗ ████║████╗ ████║██╔════╝██╔══██╗
     ███████║██║     █████╗   ╚███╔╝    ██║██╔████╔██║██╔████╔██║█████╗  ██████╔╝
     ██╔══██║██║     ██╔══╝   ██╔██╗    ██║██║╚██╔╝██║██║╚██╔╝██║██╔══╝  ██╔══██╗
     ██║  ██║███████╗███████╗██╔╝ ██╗██╗██║██║ ╚═╝ ██║██║ ╚═╝ ██║███████╗██║  ██║
     ╚═╝  ╚═╝╚══════╝╚══════╝╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═╝╚═╝╚═╝     ╚═╝╚═╝     ╚═╝╚══════╝╚═╝  ╚═╝
</pre>
        </div>
        <p
          class="text-subtitle-responsive text-palette-900 dark:text-gray-300 font-proto break-words px-sm-responsive leading-relaxed hyphens-auto"
        >
          Celebrating the golden age of 8-bit chip music made using programmable sound generator sound chips or synthesizers in vintage arcade machines, computers and video game consoles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4xl-responsive items-center mb-4xl-responsive"
      >
        <!-- Profile -->
        <div class="order-2 lg:order-1">
          <h2
            class="text-4xl-responsive font-retro text-palette-900 dark:text-white mb-2xl-responsive retro-text-subtle-glow"
          >
            Alex Mbugua Ngugi
          </h2>
          <p
            class="text-palette-900 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2xl-responsive leading-relaxed font-proto text-base-responsive"
          >
            Welcome to my chip music player! I'm Alex, a passionate developer and musician who grew
            up during the golden age of 8-bit and 16-bit gaming. This project combines my love for
            nostalgic chip tune music with modern web technologies.
          </p>
          <p
            class="text-palette-900 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2xl-responsive leading-relaxed font-proto text-base-responsive"
          >
            The music featured here represents years of experimentation with synthesizers, audio
            programming, and modern production techniques. Each track is crafted to evoke the spirit
            of classic arcade games, home computers, and the demoscene culture, delivered in
            high-quality MP3 format.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- About Image - Full Image Display with Center Alignment -->
        <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 flex items-center justify-center">
          <div
            class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl retro-crt max-w-lg mx-auto lg:max-w-none"
          >
            <img
              src="/art/about.png"
              alt="Alex Ngugi - asce1062 profile"
              class="w-full h-auto object-contain"
              loading="eager"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Features -->
      <div class="mb-4xl-responsive">
        <h2
          class="text-4xl-responsive font-retro text-palette-900 dark:text-white mb-3xl-responsive text-center retro-text-subtle-glow"
        >
          Features
        </h2>
        <div class="space-responsive">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-lg-responsive p-2xl-responsive">
            <i
              class="icon-mp3 text-palette-800 dark:text-palette-300 icon-xl flex-shrink-0 mt-sm-responsive"
            ></i>
            <div>
              <h3
                class="text-xl-responsive font-retro text-palette-900 dark:text-white mb-sm-responsive"
              >
                High-Quality MP3 Audio
              </h3>
              <p class="text-palette-900 dark:text-gray-300 font-proto text-sm-responsive">
                All tracks are delivered in high-quality MP3 format, ensuring compatibility across
                all devices and browsers while maintaining excellent audio fidelity.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-lg-responsive p-2xl-responsive">
            <i
              class="icon-phone text-palette-300 dark:text-palette-300 icon-xl flex-shrink-0 mt-sm-responsive"
            ></i>
            <div>
              <h3
                class="text-xl-responsive font-retro text-palette-900 dark:text-white mb-sm-responsive"
              >
                Mobile-First Design
              </h3>
              <p class="text-palette-900 dark:text-gray-300 font-proto text-sm-responsive">
                Responsive design optimized for mobile devices with touch-friendly controls and
                seamless playback across all screen sizes.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-lg-responsive p-2xl-responsive">
            <i
              class="icon-binoculars text-palette-600 dark:text-palette-500 icon-xl flex-shrink-0 mt-sm-responsive"
            ></i>
            <div>
              <h3
                class="text-xl-responsive font-retro text-palette-900 dark:text-white mb-sm-responsive"
              >
                Advanced Search
              </h3>
              <p class="text-palette-900 dark:text-gray-300 font-proto text-sm-responsive">
                Powerful search functionality with live filtering by track title, album, genre, and
                format. Keyboard shortcuts for power users.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-lg-responsive p-2xl-responsive">
            <i
              class="icon-cloud-download text-palette-500 dark:text-palette-600 icon-xl flex-shrink-0 mt-sm-responsive"
            ></i>
            <div>
              <h3
                class="text-xl-responsive font-retro text-palette-900 dark:text-white mb-sm-responsive"
              >
                Custom Downloads
              </h3>
              <p class="text-palette-900 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm-responsive font-proto">
                Create custom ZIP packages with your favorite tracks for offline listening.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Technology Stack - Clean Icon Row with Larger Icons -->
      <div class="mb-4xl-responsive">
        <h2
          class="text-4xl-responsive font-retro text-palette-900 dark:text-white mb-3xl-responsive text-center retro-text-subtle-glow"
        >
          Technology Stack
        </h2>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4xl-responsive flex-wrap">
          <i
            class="icon-astro text-palette-800 dark:text-palette-300 icon-xl hover:text-palette-300 dark:hover:text-palette-400 transition-colors"
            title="Astro"></i>
          <i
            class="icon-tailwindcss text-palette-500 dark:text-palette-500 icon-xl hover:text-palette-300 dark:hover:text-palette-400 transition-colors"
            title="Tailwind CSS"></i>
          <i
            class="icon-javascript text-palette-300 dark:text-palette-400 icon-xl hover:text-palette-500 dark:hover:text-palette-500 transition-colors"
            title="JavaScript"></i>
          <i
            class="icon-mp3 text-palette-600 dark:text-palette-600 icon-xl hover:text-palette-300 dark:hover:text-palette-400 transition-colors"
            title="MP3 Audio"></i>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <div class="text-center">
        <h2
          class="text-4xl-responsive font-retro text-palette-900 dark:text-white mb-2xl-responsive retro-text-subtle-glow"
        >
          Get in Touch
        </h2>
        <p
          class="text-palette-900 dark:text-gray-300 mb-3xl-responsive max-w-2xl mx-auto font-proto text-base-responsive break-words px-sm-responsive leading-relaxed"
        >
          Have questions about the music, want to collaborate, or just want to chat about retro
          gaming and chip tunes? I'd love to hear from you!
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2xl-responsive flex-wrap">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/asce1062"
            class="flex items-center justify-center gap-sm-responsive px-2xl-responsive py-lg-responsive bg-palette-800 hover:bg-palette-300 text-white hover:text-palette-900 dark:bg-palette-300 dark:hover:bg-palette-400 dark:text-palette-900 font-proto text-sm-responsive rounded-lg transition-all duration-200"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
            <i class="icon-github icon-md"></i>
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a
            href="mailto:tnkratos@gmail.com"
            class="flex items-center justify-center gap-sm-responsive px-2xl-responsive py-lg-responsive border border-palette-800 text-palette-800 hover:bg-palette-800 hover:text-white dark:border-palette-300 dark:text-palette-300 dark:hover:bg-palette-300 dark:hover:text-palette-900 font-proto text-sm-responsive rounded-lg transition-all duration-200"
          >
            <i class="icon-envelope-at icon-md"></i>
            Contact
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Enhanced responsive text handling */
  .hyphens-auto {
    hyphens: auto;
    word-break: break-word;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  /* ASCII Art Responsive Styling */
  /* Responsive breakpoints for ASCII art */
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ascii-art {
      font-size: clamp(0.25rem, 2.5vw, 0.4rem);
      letter-spacing: clamp(-0.1em, -0.05em, -0.02em);
      padding: clamp(0.25rem, 1vw, 0.5rem);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ascii-art {
      font-size: clamp(0.4rem, 1.8vw, 0.6rem);
      letter-spacing: clamp(-0.05em, -0.03em, -0.01em);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 769px) and (max-width: 1024px) {
    .ascii-art {
      font-size: clamp(0.6rem, 1.5vw, 0.7rem);
      letter-spacing: clamp(-0.03em, -0.02em, 0);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1025px) {
    .ascii-art {
      font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 1.2vw, 0.75rem);
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }
  }

  /* Ensure ASCII art doesn't break on very small screens */
  @media (max-width: 320px) {
    .ascii-art {
      font-size: 0.2rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.1em;
      transform: scale(0.9);
      transform-origin: center;
    }
  }

  /* Enhanced glow effect for ASCII art in dark mode */
  html.dark .ascii-art {
    text-shadow:
      0 0 clamp(1px, 0.2vw, 2px) rgba(220, 184, 176, 0.6),
      0 0 clamp(2px, 0.4vw, 4px) rgba(220, 184, 176, 0.4),
      0 0 clamp(4px, 0.8vw, 8px) rgba(155, 176, 205, 0.3);
  }
</style>
